title: Start
tags: intro mystery
colorID: 0
position: 100,100
---
<<declare $clues_found = 0>>
<<declare $has_key = false>>
<<declare $trust_level = 0>>
<<declare $investigated_library = false>>

You wake up in a mysterious mansion with no memory of how you got here. #narration

A note on the table reads: "Find the three clues to escape." #narration

-> Explore the library 📚
    <<jump Library>>
-> Check the garden 🌺
    <<jump Garden>>
-> Examine the locked door 🚪
    <<jump LockedDoor>>
===

title: Library
tags: location clue_location
colorID: 2
position: 400,50
---
<<set $investigated_library to true>>

The library is filled with ancient books. Dust dances in the sunlight. #narration

<<if $clues_found >= 1>>
    You notice something you missed before... #thought
<<endif>>

-> Search the bookshelf 🔍
    You find a mysterious journal! It mentions a hidden key in the garden. #discovery
    <<set $clues_found to $clues_found + 1>>
    <<jump Explore>>
-> Read the desk papers 📄
    The papers are covered in strange symbols. You can't understand them yet. #narration
    <<jump Explore>>
===

title: Garden
tags: location clue_location
colorID: 3
position: 400,300
---
The garden is overgrown but beautiful. Roses bloom everywhere. #narration

<<if $investigated_library>>
    You remember the journal mentioned a key here! #thought
<<endif>>

-> Dig near the old fountain ⛲
    <<if $investigated_library>>
        You find a rusty key! #discovery
        <<set $has_key to true>>
        <<set $clues_found to $clues_found + 1>>
    <<else>>
        Nothing but dirt and roots. Maybe you need a hint first? #narration
    <<endif>>
    <<jump Explore>>
-> Smell the roses 🌹
    They smell wonderful, but this doesn't help you escape. #narration
    <<set $trust_level to $trust_level + 1>>
    <<jump Explore>>
===

title: LockedDoor
tags: location puzzle
colorID: 4
position: 400,550
---
A heavy wooden door blocks your way. There's a keyhole. #narration

<<if $has_key>>
    You have the key! But the inscription reads: "Only those who find all three clues may pass." #narration
    <<if $clues_found >= 3>>
        <<jump Victory>>
    <<else>>
        You need {3 - $clues_found} more clue(s)! #thought
        <<jump Explore>>
    <<endif>>
<<else>>
    The door is locked. You need a key. #narration
    <<jump Explore>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Explore
tags: hub
colorID: 1
position: 700,300
---
Where do you want to go? #thought

Clues found: {$clues_found}/3 | Key: {$has_key} #status

-> The library 📚
    <<jump Library>>
-> The garden 🌺
    <<jump Garden>>
-> The locked door 🚪
    <<jump LockedDoor>>
<<if $clues_found >= 2 and !$has_key>>
-> Search more carefully... 🔎
    <<jump SecretClue>>
<<endif>>
===

title: SecretClue
tags: secret clue_location
colorID: 5
position: 700,500
---
You notice a painting that looks odd... #thought

Behind it, you find the third clue: a map of the mansion! #discovery
<<set $clues_found to $clues_found + 1>>
<<set $trust_level to $trust_level + 2>>
<<jump Explore>>
===

title: Victory
tags: ending success
colorID: 2
position: 900,300
---
🎉 You insert the key and turn it slowly... 🎉 #narration

The door swings open! Beyond it, you see sunlight and freedom! #discovery

You solved the mystery and escaped the mansion! #success

**Final Stats:**
- Clues Found: {$clues_found}
- Trust Level: {$trust_level}
- Key Obtained: {$has_key}

Congratulations! You're free! 🌟 #final

<<stop>>
===
